      "constraints": [
        "Time limit: 4 sec; Memory limit: 1024 MiB; Constraints: 1 \\leq N \\leq 2 \\times 10^5; 1 \\leq M \\leq 2 \\times 10^5; 1 \\leq A_i \\leq 10^{18}; 1 \\leq Y_i \\leq X_i \\leq 10^{18}; i \\neq j \\Rightarrow (X_i, Y_i) \\neq (X_j, Y_j); All values in input are integers."
